# ZEUS — clean routes (ZEUS FULL UPDATE, Part 1)
# Status 200 = serve the file at the clean URL (no visible change).
# These mirror the next.config.ts rewrites used by the dev server.
# Query strings are passed through automatically (e.g. /discover?genre=28,
# /movie?id=123). Explicit entries come FIRST; the /* fallback only
# catches unknown paths so deep links always land on the right page.
